[[DeFoe]] used the spell. {{source|TCG:SAS-144|SAS-144}}

The [[Guardians of Thor]] used Thundercut multiple times throughout their attempts to stop the Huntik team from recovering [[Mjolnir]]. {{Source|Two Powers Become One}}

[[Unnamed Suit 026]] used the spell<ref>Though every dub calls it with the wrong name, such as [[Augerfrost]] or [[Hyperstride]], it is clearly a Thundercut spell.</ref> at point blank range on [[Dante Vale]] in [[New Grange Passage Tomb]]. Despite him being in serious pain, [[Zhalia Moon]] was hesitant to intervene and Dante was saved by [[Sabriel]]. {{source|Home Turf}}

[[Unnamed Suit 029]] started casting the spell while fighting against [[Dante Vale]] in the train, but Dante dodged it. {{source|The Vampire Loses Its Fangs}}

In [[Atlantis]], the [[Mermen]] used this spell on [[Dante Vale]] during his test. [[Rassimov]] later used it to inflict paralyzing pain to [[Lok Lambert]] and knock him to the ground. {{source|Coming of Age}}

After discovering that Zhalia was a spy, [[Tantras]] knocked her out then started casting Thundercut to finish her off, but her [[Powerbond|powerbonding]] with [[Gareon]] stopped him. {{source|Sophie on Trial}}

[[Harrison Fears]] used the spell while dueling with his brother [[Den Fears]]. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

